# SEO & GEO Audit Report — Rumuze Landing Page
**Date:** 2026-03-02  
**Overall Score:** 96/100

---

## Executive Summary
The Rumuze React application demonstrates an exceptionally high standard of technical SEO and Generative Engine Optimization (GEO). The architecture utilizes a Client-Side Rendering (CSR) approach augmented by a highly effective Puppeteer-based pre-rendering pipeline for search bots. Core Web Vitals are proactively managed via dynamic imports, explicit resource preconnections, and responsive WebP image pipelines. The structural semantic tagging and JSON-LD schema generation (specifically for Services, FAQs, and E-E-A-T signals) are enterprise-grade. Only a few minor optimizations separate this codebase from perfect technical compliance.

