## Detailed Findings by Category

### 1. 🔍 RENDERING STRATEGY ANALYSIS
- **Current Strategy:** Client-Side Rendering (CSR) via Vite, augmented with a custom [scripts/prerender.js](file:///Volumes/main/new/projects/Rumuze/landing-page/scripts/prerender.js) Snapshot Generator.
- **Assessment:** Excellent. By using Puppeteer post-build, the project successfully generates static HTML snapshots for all safe paths. This guarantees 100% crawlability by Googlebot while maintaining the interactive speed of an SPA.
- **Recommendations:** Ensure trailing slash consistency in the router configuration to match the exact paths generated by the sitemap prior to Puppeteer execution.

### 2. 🏷️ META TAGS & HEAD MANAGEMENT
- **Current Setup:** Utilizes `react-helmet-async` with a robust custom [SEO.jsx](file:///Volumes/main/new/projects/Rumuze/landing-page/src/components/SEO.jsx) and [GEOSEO.jsx](file:///Volumes/main/new/projects/Rumuze/landing-page/src/components/GEOSEO.jsx) wrapper component.
- **Assessment:** Perfect execution. The system dynamically generates Open Graph tags, Twitter cards, and Canonical URLs. It incorporates a brilliant fallback `useEffect` in [SEO.jsx](file:///Volumes/main/new/projects/Rumuze/landing-page/src/components/SEO.jsx) to directly mutate the DOM, bypassing recent React 19 / Helmet asynchronous mismatch issues. 
- **E-E-A-T & AI Tags:** The site injects cutting-edge AI directives (`entity-type`, `ai-target-audience`) explicitly for platforms searching for authoritative answers.

### 3. 🗺️ SITEMAP & ROBOTS.TXT
- **Current Setup:** Custom Node scripts run at build time ([scripts/generate-sitemap.js](file:///Volumes/main/new/projects/Rumuze/landing-page/scripts/generate-sitemap.js)).
- **Assessment:** [robots.txt](file:///Volumes/main/new/projects/Rumuze/landing-page/public/robots.txt) explicitly allows AI crawlers (`GPTBot`, `CCBot`, `Google-Extended`). The sitemap natively handles `hreflang` alternates concurrently, ensuring perfect multilingual cross-linking.

### 4. 📐 STRUCTURED DATA (Schema.org)
- **Current Setup:** Dynamic semantic graphs generated in `src/seo/*`.
- **Assessment:** State-of-the-art implementation. Generates `WebPage`, `BreadcrumbList`, `Organization`, `WebSite`, `Person`, [Service](file:///Volumes/main/new/projects/Rumuze/landing-page/src/seo/buildServiceSchema.ts#6-52), and `FAQPage`. Native DOM-injected `itemScope` properties are correctly paired inside components like [HomepageFAQBlock.jsx](file:///Volumes/main/new/projects/Rumuze/landing-page/src/components/HomepageFAQBlock.jsx).

### 5. ⚡ CORE WEB VITALS & PERFORMANCE
- **Current Setup:** Code-splitting via `React.lazy()` and `Suspense` in [App.jsx](file:///Volumes/main/new/projects/Rumuze/landing-page/src/App.jsx). [OptimizedImage.jsx](file:///Volumes/main/new/projects/Rumuze/landing-page/src/components/OptimizedImage.jsx) manages `srcset`, breakpoints, and WebP formatting via Unsplash APIs.
- **Assessment:** The use of `fetchpriority` and `loading="lazy"` via the `priority` prop is executed correctly. Zero-JS Loading Skeleton ensures zero Cumulative Layout Shift (CLS) on the initial mount.
- **Recommendations:** Force `priority={true}` on the LCP image strictly within the `<Hero />` component to optimize the critical rendering path.

### 6. 🔗 URL STRUCTURE & ROUTING
- **Current Setup:** Next-generation `react-router-dom` using `BrowserRouter` (no hash routing).
- **Assessment:** SEO-friendly URL slugs are present (`/services/:slug`). The 404 handler (`<Route path="*" />`) is properly configured and successfully excluded from the [prerender.js](file:///Volumes/main/new/projects/Rumuze/landing-page/scripts/prerender.js) script to avoid polluting the index.

### 7. 🌍 GEO (Generative Engine Optimization)
- **Assessment:** The architecture relies heavily on distinct semantic blocks (`HomeGEOBlocks`, [HomepageFAQBlock](file:///Volumes/main/new/projects/Rumuze/landing-page/src/components/HomepageFAQBlock.jsx#8-64)). The usage of clear `<h1 className="text-fluid-h1">` in [Hero.jsx](file:///Volumes/main/new/projects/Rumuze/landing-page/src/components/Hero.jsx) establishes correct hierarchical semantics. The inline microdata within the FAQ component (`itemProp="acceptedAnswer"`) directly feeds Generative AI interfaces for featured snippets.

### 8. 🌐 INTERNATIONALIZATION
- **Current Setup:** Full Arabic ([ar](file:///Volumes/main/new/projects/Rumuze/landing-page/scripts/prerender.js#119-131)) and English ([en](file:///Volumes/main/new/projects/Rumuze/landing-page/scripts/prerender.js#136-232)) parity using `i18next`.
- **Assessment:** Perfect execution. The app dynamically syncs the `<html>` `dir` and `lang` attributes. The sitemap natively outputs bidirectional `hreflang` links for all URLs.

### 9. 🔒 TECHNICAL HEALTH
- **Assessment:** Implements strict Service Worker ([sw.js](file:///Volumes/main/new/projects/Rumuze/landing-page/src/sw.js)) fallbacks and a strong Content Security Policy (CSP) in [index.html](file:///Volumes/main/new/projects/Rumuze/landing-page/index.html). No broken canonicals or orphaned routes were found in the scope of the router arrays.

