## Code Snippets & Solutions

### 🟡 High Priority: Preload the LCP Hero Image
To prevent slightly delayed mobile LCP scores, add a direct preload to `index.html` <head>.

```html
<!-- index.html -->
<head>
  <!-- ... existing tags ... -->
  
  <!-- Add LCP Image Preload -->
  <link 
    rel="preload" 
    as="image" 
    href="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-YOUR_HERO_ID?auto=format&fit=crop&q=65&w=800" 
    fetchpriority="high"
  >
</head>
```

### 🟢 Medium Priority: Add `knowsAbout` AI Entity Optimization
To explicitly instruct AI crawlers on Rumuze's domain expertise.

```typescript
// src/seo/buildOrganizationSchema.ts
export function buildOrganizationSchema(lang: LanguageCode) {
  // ... existing configuration
  return {
    '@context': 'https://schema.org',
    '@type': 'Organization',
    '@id': StableIds.organization,
    // ... existing properties
    
    // 🔥 ADD THIS FOR GEO:
    "knowsAbout": [
      "Enterprise Software Architecture",
      "React Native Development",
      "Cloud Infrastructure",
      "Generative AI Integration"
    ]
  };
}
```
